WEBVTT

00:00:00.628 --> 00:00:01.806
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:00:03.894 --> 00:00:05.003
What are those?

00:00:07.148 --> 00:00:08.309
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re T-shirts.

00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:12.993
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> How much are they?

00:00:16.114 --> 00:00:17.657
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re £15.

00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:23.714
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> And how much are these key rings?

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.108
<v><b>Man:</b></v> They’re £6.

00:00:32.243 --> 00:00:33.736
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> And this mug?

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:37.986
<v><b>Man:</b></v> £14.

00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:43.232
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Is that a Manchester United shirt?

00:00:47.354 --> 00:00:49.034
<v><b>Man:</b></v> No, it’s Arsenal.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:53.887
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> How much is it?

00:00:57.005 --> 00:00:58.255
<v><b>Man:</b></v> £25.

00:01:01.719 --> 00:01:03.678
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Oh…no.

00:01:03.748 --> 00:01:05.695
Thank you. Bye.